IMPORT daydate

§ `Covid-19 (Mental Health) (Jersey) Order 2020 - as at 15 January 2021`
-- Official consolidation showing the law as at 15 January 2021.
-- Source page: https://www.jerseylaw.je/laws/current/ro_166_2020_20210115
-- (That jerseylaw slug serves THIS Mental Health instrument, not Gathering Control.)
-- Instrument and making: table of legislation history cites R&O.166/2020, 23 December 2020.
-- In force as amended by R&O.177/2020 (in force 31 December 2020).
-- Parent: Mental Health (Jersey) Law 2016 (chapter 20.650); Covid-19 (Enabling Provisions) (Jersey) Law 2020.
-- ENCODING SCOPE: operative timing (Art.1) and the period-extension rule (Art.2). Arts.3-5 on
-- approved practitioners / SOAD lists and Art.6 capacity orders are administrative instructional
-- clauses; they are modelled as boolean facts where a downstream check needs them.

§§ `1 Citation, commencement and expiry - domain model`

DECLARE ApplicationKind IS ONE OF
    `Minister application under Article 9 or 10 of the Mental Health Law for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A`
    `approved social worker application under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A as applied by Article 14`
    `approved social worker application under Article 24 of the Mental Health Law for emergency treatment under Part 4`
    `other application`

DECLARE MentalHealthEpisode HAS
    `application kind`                                                             IS A ApplicationKind
    `is an application by the Minister under Article 9 or 10 for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A` IS A BOOLEAN
        MEANS `application kind` EQUALS `Minister application under Article 9 or 10 of the Mental Health Law for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A`
    `is an application by an approved social worker under Article 15 for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A as applied by Article 14` IS A BOOLEAN
        MEANS `application kind` EQUALS `approved social worker application under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A as applied by Article 14`
    `is an application by an approved social worker under Article 24 for emergency treatment under Part 4` IS A BOOLEAN
        MEANS `application kind` EQUALS `approved social worker application under Article 24 of the Mental Health Law for emergency treatment under Part 4`
    `patient is received into long-term care under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `concerns a report of an approved social worker or the discharge of a patient from long-term care under Article 18 of the Mental Health Law` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `1 Citation, commencement and expiry`

-- Art.1(2)/(3): Order remains in force until end of 30 April 2021 unless earlier revoked.
-- Art.1(4): "end of" a day means midnight at the end of that day.
-- Art.1(5): power to make under enables-provisions Law s.2 (start before making, if not before enabling Law).

`the Order expires at the end of` MEANS Date 30 4 2021

GIVEN asOf IS A DATE @desc Date against which to test whether this Order is still in force
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Order remains in force as of` asOf IF
    asOf AT MOST `the Order expires at the end of`

§§ `2 Extension of time periods under Mental Health Law`

`the standard 14 day period under the Mental Health Law` MEANS 14
`the extended period under this Order` MEANS 28

GIVEN e IS A MentalHealthEpisode
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Article 2(1) application attracts the extended period` e IF
        e's `is an application by the Minister under Article 9 or 10 for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A`
    OR  e's `is an application by an approved social worker under Article 15 for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A as applied by Article 14`
    OR  e's `is an application by an approved social worker under Article 24 for emergency treatment under Part 4`

GIVEN e IS A MentalHealthEpisode
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Article 2(2) long-term care period attracts the extended period` e IF
        e's `patient is received into long-term care under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law`
    AND e's `concerns a report of an approved social worker or the discharge of a patient from long-term care under Article 18 of the Mental Health Law`

GIVEN e IS A MentalHealthEpisode
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the extended 28 day period applies` e IF
        `Article 2(1) application attracts the extended period` e
    OR  `Article 2(2) long-term care period attracts the extended period` e

GIVEN e IS A MentalHealthEpisode
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `applicable period in days under this Order` e IS
    IF `the extended 28 day period applies` e
    THEN `the extended period under this Order`
    ELSE `the standard 14 day period under the Mental Health Law`

§§ `3 to 5 Lists and SOAD arrangements - fact hooks`
-- Arts.3-5 are administrative directions to the Minister and approved practitioners about
-- maintaining lists of approved practitioners / SOADs and making them available. They are
-- not case-level prohibitions. Encoded as facts a compliance check can require.

DECLARE PractitionerListStatus HAS
    `Minister has established a list of approved practitioners under Article 16 for the purposes of the Mental Health Law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `Minister has established a list of second opinion approved doctors under Article 16 for the purposes of the Mental Health Law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the list or lists of approved practitioners are kept up to date` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the list or lists of second opinion approved doctors are kept up to date` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an approved practitioner requesting a copy of a list is provided with one` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN s IS A PractitionerListStatus
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Articles 3 to 5 list arrangements are met` s IF
        s's `Minister has established a list of approved practitioners under Article 16 for the purposes of the Mental Health Law`
    AND s's `Minister has established a list of second opinion approved doctors under Article 16 for the purposes of the Mental Health Law`
    AND s's `the list or lists of approved practitioners are kept up to date`
    AND s's `the list or lists of second opinion approved doctors are kept up to date`
    AND s's `an approved practitioner requesting a copy of a list is provided with one`

§§ `exported decisions`

@export Whether the Covid-19 (Mental Health) (Jersey) Order 2020 remains in force as of a given date (expires at the end of 30 April 2021)
GIVEN asOf IS A DATE @desc ISO date to test, e.g. 2021-04-30 still in force; 2021-05-01 not
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Order remains in force as of` IF
    `the Order remains in force as of` asOf

@export Whether the 28-day extended period under Article 2 of this Order replaces the Mental Health Law 14-day period for this episode
GIVEN e IS A MentalHealthEpisode @desc Episode / application facts: application kind and Art.18 long-term care flags
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `extended period applies to episode` IF
    `the extended 28 day period applies` e

@export The number of days that apply to this episode under the Order (28 if extended, otherwise the Mental Health Law's 14)
GIVEN e IS A MentalHealthEpisode @desc Episode / application facts: application kind and Art.18 long-term care flags
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `applicable period in days` IS
    `applicable period in days under this Order` e

@export Whether the Minister's Art.3-5 list and SOAD arrangements are all in place
GIVEN s IS A PractitionerListStatus @desc Status of approved-practitioner and SOAD lists under Arts.3-5
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `list arrangements are complete` IF
    `Articles 3 to 5 list arrangements are met` s

§§ `test cases - as at 15 January 2021`

`minister admission application` MEANS MentalHealthEpisode WITH
    `application kind`                                                                                                     IS `Minister application under Article 9 or 10 of the Mental Health Law for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A`
    `patient is received into long-term care under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law`                                    IS FALSE
    `concerns a report of an approved social worker or the discharge of a patient from long-term care under Article 18 of the Mental Health Law` IS FALSE

`ASW Article 15 admission application` MEANS MentalHealthEpisode WITH
    `application kind`                                                                                                     IS `approved social worker application under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law for admission under Article 6, 7 or 7A as applied by Article 14`
    `patient is received into long-term care under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law`                                    IS FALSE
    `concerns a report of an approved social worker or the discharge of a patient from long-term care under Article 18 of the Mental Health Law` IS FALSE

`ASW Article 24 emergency application` MEANS MentalHealthEpisode WITH
    `application kind`                                                                                                     IS `approved social worker application under Article 24 of the Mental Health Law for emergency treatment under Part 4`
    `patient is received into long-term care under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law`                                    IS FALSE
    `concerns a report of an approved social worker or the discharge of a patient from long-term care under Article 18 of the Mental Health Law` IS FALSE

`other non-extended application` MEANS MentalHealthEpisode WITH
    `application kind`                                                                                                     IS `other application`
    `patient is received into long-term care under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law`                                    IS FALSE
    `concerns a report of an approved social worker or the discharge of a patient from long-term care under Article 18 of the Mental Health Law` IS FALSE

`Art 18 long-term care report episode` MEANS MentalHealthEpisode WITH
    `application kind`                                                                                                     IS `other application`
    `patient is received into long-term care under Article 15 of the Mental Health Law`                                    IS TRUE
    `concerns a report of an approved social worker or the discharge of a patient from long-term care under Article 18 of the Mental Health Law` IS TRUE

`lists complete` MEANS PractitionerListStatus WITH
    `Minister has established a list of approved practitioners under Article 16 for the purposes of the Mental Health Law` IS TRUE
    `Minister has established a list of second opinion approved doctors under Article 16 for the purposes of the Mental Health Law` IS TRUE
    `the list or lists of approved practitioners are kept up to date`                                                      IS TRUE
    `the list or lists of second opinion approved doctors are kept up to date`                                             IS TRUE
    `an approved practitioner requesting a copy of a list is provided with one`                                            IS TRUE

`lists missing SOAD update` MEANS PractitionerListStatus WITH
    `Minister has established a list of approved practitioners under Article 16 for the purposes of the Mental Health Law` IS TRUE
    `Minister has established a list of second opinion approved doctors under Article 16 for the purposes of the Mental Health Law` IS TRUE
    `the list or lists of approved practitioners are kept up to date`                                                      IS TRUE
    `the list or lists of second opinion approved doctors are kept up to date`                                             IS FALSE
    `an approved practitioner requesting a copy of a list is provided with one`                                            IS TRUE

#ASSERT `Order remains in force as of` (Date 15 1 2021)
#ASSERT `Order remains in force as of` (Date 30 4 2021)
#ASSERT NOT (`Order remains in force as of` (Date 1 5 2021))

#ASSERT `extended period applies to episode` `minister admission application`
#ASSERT `extended period applies to episode` `ASW Article 15 admission application`
#ASSERT `extended period applies to episode` `ASW Article 24 emergency application`
#ASSERT NOT (`extended period applies to episode` `other non-extended application`)
#ASSERT `extended period applies to episode` `Art 18 long-term care report episode`

#ASSERT `applicable period in days` `minister admission application` EQUALS 28
#ASSERT `applicable period in days` `other non-extended application` EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `applicable period in days` `Art 18 long-term care report episode` EQUALS 28

#ASSERT `list arrangements are complete` `lists complete`
#ASSERT NOT (`list arrangements are complete` `lists missing SOAD update`)
